vCat12\"><a href=\"/submersible-drainage-pump\" id=\"6872868\">Submersible Drainage Pump</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat13\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump\" id=\"6872872\">Sewage Submersible Pump</a><ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n<li class=\"LiLevel2\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump/ss-submersible-sewage-pump-with-float-switch\" id=\"6872928\">SS Submersible Sewage Pump with Float Switch</a></li>\n<li class=\"LiLevel2\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump/submersible-sewage-pump-with-grinder\" id=\"6872929\">Submersible Sewage Pump with Grinder</a></li>\n</ul></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat14\"><a href=\"/self-suction-screw-pump\" id=\"6872880\">Self Suction Screw Pump</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat15\"><a href=\"/submersible-solar-pump\" id=\"7719400\">Submersible Solar Pump</a></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"con_title\">Contact Us</div>\n<div class=\"contact_box\"><p>JD Frontier</p><p>ADD: City Saddar Road, Rawalpindi, Pakistan</p><p>TEL: <a href=\"tel:+92515553023\">051-5553023</a></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pro_right\">\n<div class=\"pror_wrap\">\n<div class=\"pror_detail\">\n<div class=\"fl\"><div class=\"singglepic\"><img alt=\"4 Inch High Pressure Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/high-pressure-submersible-pump57042214921.jpg\"/></div><link href=\"/images/spic.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/></div>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">4 Inch High Pressure Submersible Pump</h1>\n<p>We supply 4 Inch High Pressure Submersible Pump. Equipped with permanent magnet motors, these flexible and compact pumps offer excellent efficiency levels and will supply pump heads up to 406 m.</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"80347964\"/></p><p><strong>4 Inch High Pressure Submersible Pump</strong><br/></p><p><img alt=\"image007(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231503155441759.jpg\"/></p><p>We supply 4 Inch High Pressure Submersible Pump. Equipped with permanent magnet motors, these flexible and compact pumps offer excellent efficiency levels and will supply pump heads up to 406 m.</p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter (specification)</strong></p><p><strong>Categories:</strong> submersible pumps</p><p><strong>Flow</strong> (m3/h): 4.5</p><p><strong>Head</strong> (m): 5 / 406</p><p><strong>Power</strong> (kW): 0.25 / 4</p><p><strong>Construction:</strong></p><p>Submersible motor pumps for deep wells of 4″ (DN 100 mm).</p><p>Sized for connection to the motor according to NEMA Standards.</p><p>Delivery casing with built-in non-return valve.</p><p>Delivery port G 1 1/4. Radial floating impeller with high reliability operating in sandy water.</p><p>Performance:</p><p>Capacity up to 4.5 m3/h.</p><p>Head up to 406m.</p><p>Rated motor power output up to 4 kW.</p><p>Rotation speed 2850 r.p.m. (motor frequency 50 Hz).</p><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image009(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231503283722275.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image005(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231503003529751.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></strong></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Plastic Impeller </p><p><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231503413602907.jpg\"/></p><p>·High durable plastic, long-time using, </p><p>sand resistant</p><p><br/></p></td><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Mechanical Seal</p><p><img alt=\"image013(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231503497223623.jpg\"/></p><p>·Super-high precision Carborundum Graphite mechanical seal</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Rotor Shaft</p><p><img alt=\"image015(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231503599617456.jpg\"/></p><p>·Super-high precision machine process</p><p>·Super smooth shaft surface(mirror finish), protecting mechanical seal against wear</p><p><br/></p></td><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Bearing </p><p><img alt=\"image017(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231504108497259.jpg\"/></p><p>·C&amp;U brand, longer working life</p><p>·Better balance and less noise</p><p><br/></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4. Product Application</strong></p><p>JIADI high pressure submersible pump are suitable for both continuous and intermittent operation for a variety of applications:</p><p>Ground water supply – private housing, small waterworks, irrigation in horticulture and agriculture water systems</p><p>Liquid transfer in tanks</p><p>Pressure boosting</p><p>Industrial applications</p><p><img alt=\"image019(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231509192754868.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>5. Our Services</strong></p><p>1. All products will be well packed before shipping.</p><p>2. Reply your inquiry in 24 working hours.</p><p>3. Customized design is available.</p><p>4. Exclusive and unique solution can be provided to our customer by our well-trained and professional engineers.</p><p>5. As an honest seller, we always use high quality material, advanced machines, skilled technicians to ensure quality.</p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: 4 inch high pressure submersible pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/5-submersible-pump/5-submersible-impeller-pump/5-inch-high-performance-deep-well-pump\"><img alt=\"5 Inch High Pe